<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that PaineWebber Group Inc and Echlin Inc were not available for after-hours trading for news.  </p>
<p>The exchange said AMRE Inc, Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock were also unavailable for trading.</p>
